  "rationale": "Reference baseline and lineage root, not a candidate: the published growth law of a burner-supported spherical diffusion flame with its published constants for inverse flames (rhoD 0.0334 g/m/s, critical oxygen flux 0.68 g/m2/s, D 28 mm2/s at 1 atm and inversely proportional to pressure) and nothing else: no establishment time, no weak class, no second clock, no burner limit, no programmed stop. No number was taken from the PSI-159 tables. Data-informed candidates of acme_inverse-wsp-v3 are literal revisions of this release, so that the registry records them as revisions with development exposure.",
